Telemetry matches the hosted extractor schema.

- `escape_issue`: `event`, `tick`, `agent`, `generation`, `previousRun`, `baselineAction`, `action`, `issued`
- `escape_result`: `event`, `tick`, `issueTick`, `agent`, `generation`, `action`, `anim`, `success`, `dr`, `dc`, `issued`, `confirmed`, `failed`

`tick` is the wire JSON tick passed into `act`. An issue uses the action-reply tick. A result uses the next valid observation tick plus `issueTick`. Baseline is the untrimmed preference pick on the same `safeMoves` set; an issue is counted only when the returned movement differs. Failed secondary runs and failed primaries already absent from `allowed` are not counted. Reset clears pending only; counters stay per-agent.

